  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Before autoclaving, adjust pH to 7.6 -- 7.8 for agar plate and to 7.4 -- 7.6 for liquid medium. Autoclave at 115C for 20 min. Separately sterilize Solution B by filtration and add to the medium aseptically."
